# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
.a {
  color: IF(true, red, blue);
  color: If(true, red, blue);
  color: \49 F(true, red, blue);
}

@function spacing($value) {
  @return $value * 4px;
}

.b {
  margin: spacing(1);
  padding: undeclared(1);
  width: spacingx(1);
}

```

